[
  {
    "start": 20.0,
    "end": 20.634,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 28.96,
    "end": 29.935,
    "text": "You made it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 36.63,
    "end": 38.023,
    "text": "The day is over..."
  },
  {
    "start": 44.72,
    "end": 49.039,
    "text": "And you're here now, lying down, eyes closing..."
  },
  {
    "start": 57.07,
    "end": 59.578,
    "text": "That's the only thing that matters..."
  },
  {
    "start": 70.29,
    "end": 73.262,
    "text": "Take a breath in, as deep as feels good..."
  },
  {
    "start": 81.3,
    "end": 84.265,
    "text": "And let it pour out of you, slow and heavy..."
  },
  {
    "start": 94.98,
    "end": 96.737,
    "text": "Again. Filling up..."
  },
  {
    "start": 104.77,
    "end": 106.21,
    "text": "And emptying out..."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.92,
    "end": 119.163,
    "text": "One more. Deep breath in..."
  },
  {
    "start": 127.2,
    "end": 131.38,
    "text": "And this time, let everything leave with the exhale..."
  },
  {
    "start": 138.07,
    "end": 142.342,
    "text": "Every thought. Every plan. Every unfinished thing..."
  },
  {
    "start": 149.04,
    "end": 149.86,
    "text": "Gone..."
  },
  {
    "start": 173.96,
    "end": 176.134,
    "text": "Feel the weight of your body..."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.17,
    "end": 185.61,
    "text": "Really feel it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 193.64,
    "end": 195.869,
    "text": "How heavy your head is on the pillow..."
  },
  {
    "start": 203.9,
    "end": 206.779,
    "text": "How your back is pressing into the mattress..."
  },
  {
    "start": 214.82,
    "end": 217.263,
    "text": "You're not floating. You're sinking..."
  },
  {
    "start": 223.96,
    "end": 225.678,
    "text": "And that's exactly right..."
  },
  {
    "start": 236.39,
    "end": 238.062,
    "text": "Start with your face..."
  },
  {
    "start": 246.09,
    "end": 249.155,
    "text": "Feel the skin across your forehead go slack..."
  },
  {
    "start": 255.85,
    "end": 263.373,
    "text": "Like every wrinkle, every crease, every held expression from today is smoothing itself out..."
  },
  {
    "start": 274.09,
    "end": 275.158,
    "text": "Your eyes..."
  },
  {
    "start": 281.85,
    "end": 283.986,
    "text": "So tired of looking at things..."
  },
  {
    "start": 290.68,
    "end": 293.234,
    "text": "Let them rest deep in their softness..."
  },
  {
    "start": 299.93,
    "end": 302.809,
    "text": "Heavy. Still. Done looking for today..."
  },
  {
    "start": 313.52,
    "end": 314.588,
    "text": "Your jaw..."
  },
  {
    "start": 321.28,
    "end": 323.648,
    "text": "Let it fall open, just slightly..."
  },
  {
    "start": 330.35,
    "end": 333.09,
    "text": "Feel the relief of not holding it together..."
  },
  {
    "start": 339.78,
    "end": 342.566,
    "text": "All the words from today, finished..."
  },
  {
    "start": 349.26,
    "end": 353.848,
    "text": "All the smiles, the expressions, the composure, finished..."
  },
  {
    "start": 360.55,
    "end": 363.383,
    "text": "Your face belongs to no one right now..."
  },
  {
    "start": 376.77,
    "end": 379.544,
    "text": "The heaviness moves into your neck..."
  },
  {
    "start": 387.58,
    "end": 395.939,
    "text": "Feel it let go of all the turning, all the looking, all the holding your head up..."
  },
  {
    "start": 403.97,
    "end": 405.642,
    "text": "The pillow has it now..."
  },
  {
    "start": 412.34,
    "end": 414.383,
    "text": "You can stop carrying it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 425.09,
    "end": 426.349,
    "text": "Your shoulders..."
  },
  {
    "start": 434.39,
    "end": 436.387,
    "text": "Feel them melt downward..."
  },
  {
    "start": 443.08,
    "end": 446.238,
    "text": "Like warm wax spreading across a table..."
  },
  {
    "start": 452.93,
    "end": 455.632,
    "text": "All the responsibility they've been holding..."
  },
  {
    "start": 462.33,
    "end": 464.756,
    "text": "All the tension they've been storing..."
  },
  {
    "start": 471.45,
    "end": 477.114,
    "text": "It's draining out of them now, into the bed, into the dark..."
  },
  {
    "start": 490.5,
    "end": 491.661,
    "text": "Your arms..."
  },
  {
    "start": 499.7,
    "end": 502.161,
    "text": "So heavy they couldn't lift if you tried..."
  },
  {
    "start": 508.85,
    "end": 510.745,
    "text": "Your hands uncurling..."
  },
  {
    "start": 517.44,
    "end": 518.833,
    "text": "Fingers loose..."
  },
  {
    "start": 525.53,
    "end": 527.672,
    "text": "Palms open and warm..."
  },
  {
    "start": 534.37,
    "end": 535.995,
    "text": "Nothing left to grip..."
  },
  {
    "start": 542.69,
    "end": 546.312,
    "text": "Nothing left to type, to scroll, to hold..."
  },
  {
    "start": 553.01,
    "end": 555.123,
    "text": "Your hands are done for the day..."
  },
  {
    "start": 568.51,
    "end": 569.857,
    "text": "Now your chest..."
  },
  {
    "start": 577.89,
    "end": 580.258,
    "text": "Feel it soften with each breath..."
  },
  {
    "start": 586.95,
    "end": 589.969,
    "text": "Feel the breath getting slower on its own..."
  },
  {
    "start": 596.67,
    "end": 598.806,
    "text": "You're not controlling it anymore..."
  },
  {
    "start": 605.5,
    "end": 606.986,
    "text": "It's breathing you..."
  },
  {
    "start": 613.68,
    "end": 615.77,
    "text": "Slow. Deep. Easy..."
  },
  {
    "start": 629.16,
    "end": 630.739,
    "text": "Notice your heartbeat..."
  },
  {
    "start": 638.77,
    "end": 640.117,
    "text": "You can feel it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 646.81,
    "end": 647.971,
    "text": "Slower now..."
  },
  {
    "start": 654.67,
    "end": 657.038,
    "text": "Each beat a little further apart..."
  },
  {
    "start": 663.73,
    "end": 664.845,
    "text": "Quieter..."
  },
  {
    "start": 671.54,
    "end": 672.489,
    "text": "Softer..."
  },
  {
    "start": 679.19,
    "end": 681.001,
    "text": "Fading into the background..."
  },
  {
    "start": 694.39,
    "end": 696.279,
    "text": "Your abdomen releasing..."
  },
  {
    "start": 704.31,
    "end": 711.09,
    "text": "All the knots, all the holding, all the gut-level stress from today..."
  },
  {
    "start": 717.78,
    "end": 719.08,
    "text": "Unwinding..."
  },
  {
    "start": 725.78,
    "end": 726.925,
    "text": "Softening..."
  },
  {
    "start": 733.62,
    "end": 737.521,
    "text": "Your center of gravity dropping deeper into the mattress..."
  },
  {
    "start": 748.23,
    "end": 749.298,
    "text": "Your hips..."
  },
  {
    "start": 757.34,
    "end": 758.763,
    "text": "Heavy as stone..."
  },
  {
    "start": 765.45,
    "end": 766.588,
    "text": "Your legs..."
  },
  {
    "start": 773.29,
    "end": 775.426,
    "text": "Feel them go completely limp..."
  },
  {
    "start": 782.12,
    "end": 784.303,
    "text": "Like they've forgotten how to move..."
  },
  {
    "start": 791.0,
    "end": 792.625,
    "text": "Like they're already asleep..."
  },
  {
    "start": 803.33,
    "end": 804.352,
    "text": "Your feet..."
  },
  {
    "start": 811.05,
    "end": 813.752,
    "text": "Warm and still at the end of your body..."
  },
  {
    "start": 820.45,
    "end": 825.001,
    "text": "Done walking. Done standing. Done carrying you through the day..."
  },
  {
    "start": 835.71,
    "end": 837.753,
    "text": "Your whole body is heavy now..."
  },
  {
    "start": 845.79,
    "end": 846.812,
    "text": "So heavy..."
  },
  {
    "start": 854.84,
    "end": 857.739,
    "text": "Like you're made of something dense and warm..."
  },
  {
    "start": 864.44,
    "end": 867.83,
    "text": "Sinking deeper into the bed with every breath..."
  },
  {
    "start": 874.52,
    "end": 877.678,
    "text": "The mattress is swallowing you, gently..."
  },
  {
    "start": 884.37,
    "end": 886.506,
    "text": "And it feels so good to let it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 899.9,
    "end": 902.686,
    "text": "Now, feel your mind getting quieter..."
  },
  {
    "start": 912.06,
    "end": 916.379,
    "text": "Whatever thoughts are left, they're far away now..."
  },
  {
    "start": 923.07,
    "end": 925.215,
    "text": "Like voices in another room..."
  },
  {
    "start": 931.91,
    "end": 933.935,
    "text": "You can hear them, barely..."
  },
  {
    "start": 940.63,
    "end": 942.813,
    "text": "But they've got nothing to do with you..."
  },
  {
    "start": 949.51,
    "end": 950.903,
    "text": "Let them talk..."
  },
  {
    "start": 957.6,
    "end": 959.486,
    "text": "You're not in that room anymore..."
  },
  {
    "start": 972.88,
    "end": 974.598,
    "text": "You're somewhere darker..."
  },
  {
    "start": 982.63,
    "end": 984.01,
    "text": "Somewhere deeper..."
  },
  {
    "start": 992.04,
    "end": 995.616,
    "text": "Somewhere warm and still and completely safe..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1006.33,
    "end": 1007.896,
    "text": "There's nothing here..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1014.59,
    "end": 1018.305,
    "text": "No tasks. No time. No tomorrow..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1025.0,
    "end": 1026.347,
    "text": "Just the dark..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1033.04,
    "end": 1034.169,
    "text": "And your breath..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1040.87,
    "end": 1042.178,
    "text": "Getting slower..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1048.87,
    "end": 1049.985,
    "text": "And slower..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1074.09,
    "end": 1075.808,
    "text": "You're almost there now..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1085.18,
    "end": 1087.908,
    "text": "That edge between awake and asleep..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1097.28,
    "end": 1098.627,
    "text": "You can feel it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1108.0,
    "end": 1110.183,
    "text": "A softness pulling you down..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1119.55,
    "end": 1120.386,
    "text": "Let it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1133.78,
    "end": 1135.498,
    "text": "You've done enough today..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1144.87,
    "end": 1146.542,
    "text": "You've done enough this week..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1155.92,
    "end": 1157.288,
    "text": "You've done enough..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1170.67,
    "end": 1171.645,
    "text": "Let go..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1182.36,
    "end": 1183.939,
    "text": "Let go of all of it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1194.65,
    "end": 1196.461,
    "text": "Let your body have this..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1207.18,
    "end": 1208.991,
    "text": "Let your mind go dark..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1222.38,
    "end": 1223.719,
    "text": "Sleep is here..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1234.43,
    "end": 1235.591,
    "text": "Fall into it..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1248.98,
    "end": 1250.002,
    "text": "Goodnight."
  }
]
